page: the studio's lens makers. Each reads a file and writes a page of nodes.

  py        a python file: its classes and defs, the source as written
  diff      a diff: its files and hunks
  run.mjs   the check, for any page made on page.html

The node, from ../page.html: details#id > summary(heading, edge) + body.

Check
  node run.mjs file.html        every check ok
